{
  "schemaVersion": 1,
  "root": {
    "type": "Grid",
    "props": { "columns": 12, "gap": 16 },
    "children": [
      {
        "type": "Card",
        "props": { "span": 12, "title": "Projektüberblick", "variant": "hero" },
        "data": { "dataset": "project_summary" },
        "children": [
          { "type": "KPIStrip",
            "props": {
              "items": [
                { "label": "Dateien",        "field": "file_count" },
                { "label": "Objekte",        "field": "total_objects", "format": "number" },
                { "label": "FM-Version",     "field": "fm_versions" },
                { "label": "DDR-Info",       "field": "ddr_status",    "format": "badge" },
                { "label": "Letzter Import", "field": "last_import",   "format": "date:relative" }
              ]
            }
          }
        ]
      },

      {
        "type": "Card",
        "props": { "span": 12, "title": "Objekte" },
        "data": { "dataset": "object_counts" },
        "children": [
          { "type": "KPIStrip",
            "props": {
              "items": [
                { "label": "Scripts",      "field": "scripts",
                  "onClick": { "action": "applyFilter", "args": { "type": "Script" } } },
                { "label": "Felder",       "field": "fields",
                  "onClick": { "action": "applyFilter", "args": { "type": "Field" } } },
                { "label": "Tabellen",     "field": "tables",
                  "onClick": { "action": "applyFilter", "args": { "type": "BaseTable" } } },
                { "label": "TOs",          "field": "occurrences",
                  "onClick": { "action": "applyFilter", "args": { "type": "TableOccurrence" } } },
                { "label": "Layouts",      "field": "layouts",
                  "onClick": { "action": "applyFilter", "args": { "type": "Layout" } } },
                { "label": "Custom Fns",   "field": "custom_functions",
                  "onClick": { "action": "applyFilter", "args": { "type": "CustomFunction" } } },
                { "label": "Wertelisten",  "field": "value_lists",
                  "onClick": { "action": "applyFilter", "args": { "type": "ValueList" } } },
                { "label": "Beziehungen",  "field": "relationships",
                  "onClick": { "action": "applyFilter", "args": { "type": "Relationship" } } }
              ]
            }
          }
        ]
      },

      {
        "type": "Card",
        "props": { "span": 8, "title": "Dateien" },
        "data": { "dataset": "files_overview" },
        "children": [
          { "type": "Table",
            "props": {
              "rowKey": "File_Name",
              "density": "comfortable",
              "columns": [
                { "field": "File_Name",         "label": "Datei" },
                { "field": "FileMaker_Version", "label": "FM-Version" },
                { "field": "script_count",      "label": "Scripts",   "align": "right" },
                { "field": "table_count",       "label": "Tabellen",  "align": "right" },
                { "field": "field_count",       "label": "Felder",    "align": "right" },
                { "field": "layout_count",      "label": "Layouts",   "align": "right" },
                { "field": "cf_count",          "label": "CFs",       "align": "right" },
                { "field": "Has_DDR_INFO",      "label": "DDR",       "format": "badge" },
                { "field": "Import_Timestamp",  "label": "Import",    "format": "date:relative" }
              ],
              "onRowClick": { "action": "applyFilter",
                              "args": { "file": "{{File_Name}}" } }
            }
          }
        ]
      },

      {
        "type": "Stack",
        "props": { "span": 4, "gap": 12 },
        "children": [
          {
            "type": "Card",
            "props": { "title": "Top Scripts" },
            "data": { "dataset": "top_scripts" },
            "children": [
              { "type": "List",
                "props": {
                  "rowTemplate": {
                    "primary":   "{{name}}",
                    "secondary": "{{file}} · {{step_count}} Schritte",
                    "onClick":   { "action": "openObject",
                                   "args": { "uuid": "{{uuid}}", "type": "Script" } }
                  },
                  "empty": { "message": "Keine Scripts gefunden." }
                }
              }
            ]
          },

          { "type": "Card",
            "props": { "title": "Top Tabellen" },
            "data": { "dataset": "top_tables" },
            "children": [
              { "type": "List",
                "props": {
                  "rowTemplate": {
                    "primary":   "{{name}}",
                    "secondary": "{{file}} · {{field_count}} Felder",
                    "onClick":   { "action": "openObject",
                                   "args": { "uuid": "{{uuid}}", "type": "BaseTable" } }
                  },
                  "empty": { "message": "Keine Tabellen gefunden." }
                }
              }
            ]
          },

          { "type": "Card",
            "props": { "title": "Top Layouts" },
            "data": { "dataset": "top_layouts" },
            "children": [
              { "type": "List",
                "props": {
                  "rowTemplate": {
                    "primary":   "{{name}}",
                    "secondary": "{{file}} · {{object_count}} Objekte",
                    "onClick":   { "action": "openObject",
                                   "args": { "uuid": "{{uuid}}", "type": "Layout" } }
                  },
                  "empty": { "message": "Keine Layouts gefunden." }
                }
              }
            ]
          },

          { "type": "Card",
            "props": { "title": "Top Custom Functions" },
            "data": { "dataset": "top_custom_functions" },
            "children": [
              { "type": "List",
                "props": {
                  "rowTemplate": {
                    "primary":   "{{name}}",
                    "secondary": "{{file}} · {{reference_count}}× referenziert",
                    "onClick":   { "action": "openObject",
                                   "args": { "uuid": "{{uuid}}", "type": "CustomFunction" } }
                  },
                  "empty": { "message": "Keine Custom Functions gefunden." }
                }
              }
            ]
          }
        ]
      },

      {
        "type": "Card",
        "props": { "span": 6, "title": "Health & Hinweise" },
        "data": { "dataset": "health_indicators" },
        "children": [
          { "type": "List",
            "props": {
              "rowTemplate": {
                "primary":   "{{label}}",
                "secondary": "{{value}}",
                "badge":     "{{severity}}",
                "onClick":   { "action": "{{action}}",
                               "argsString": "{{action_args}}" }
              },
              "empty": { "message": "Keine Auffälligkeiten." }
            }
          }
        ]
      },

      {
        "type": "Card",
        "props": { "span": 6, "title": "Variable-Hotspots" },
        "data": { "dataset": "variable_hotspots" },
        "children": [
          { "type": "Table",
            "props": {
              "rowKey": "name",
              "density": "compact",
              "columns": [
                { "field": "name",    "label": "Variable" },
                { "field": "scope",   "label": "Scope",   "format": "badge" },
                { "field": "sets",    "label": "Set",     "align": "right" },
                { "field": "reads",   "label": "Read",    "align": "right" },
                { "field": "scripts", "label": "Scripts", "align": "right" },
                { "field": "files",   "label": "Dateien", "align": "right" }
              ],
              "onRowClick": { "action": "openObject",
                              "args": { "uuid": "{{uuid}}", "type": "Variable" } }
            }
          }
        ]
      },

      {
        "type": "Card",
        "props": { "span": 6, "variant": "navtile" },
        "data": { "dataset": "nav_dashboards" },
        "children": [
          { "type": "NavButton",
            "props": {
              "label": "Dashboards",
              "subtitle": "Vorbereitete Analysen",
              "icon": "layout-dashboard",
              "showCount": true,
              "onClick": { "action": "openDashboard",
                           "args": { "id": "dashboards" } }
            }
          }
        ]
      },

      {
        "type": "Card",
        "props": { "span": 6, "variant": "navtile" },
        "data": { "dataset": "nav_custom_queries" },
        "children": [
          { "type": "NavButton",
            "props": {
              "label": "Custom Queries",
              "subtitle": "Wiederverwendbare SQL-Templates",
              "icon": "database-zap",
              "showCount": true,
              "onClick": { "action": "openDashboard",
                           "args": { "id": "custom_queries" } }
            }
          }
        ]
      },

      {
        "type": "Markdown",
        "props": {
          "span": 12,
          "content": "## Tipps\n\n- **Suche:** Tippe im Suchfeld einen Namen, um Objekte zu filtern — das Dashboard verschwindet automatisch.\n- **Dateien:** Klick auf eine Zeile in der Datei-Tabelle setzt den aktiven Datei-Filter für alle Folgesichten.\n- **Dashboards:** Über die Kachel *Dashboards* erreichst Du kuratierte Analysen, über *Custom Queries* alle wiederverwendbaren SQL-Templates.\n- **Details:** Klick auf einen Eintrag in einer Top-Liste öffnet die Detail-Ansicht des Objekts."
        }
      }
    ]
  }
}
